Dear {!Contact.FirstName},
We have processed your request to have your ASU ID card mailed. You should receive your ASU ID in the mail within 10 business days. Please note that a $25 fee will be billed to your Student Account within a few business days. If you have any questions, please contact us at sundevilcardinfo@asu.edu.
Regards, {!User.FirstName} {!User.LastName}
Sun Devil Card Services Arizona State University Phone: 480-965-2273 cardservices.asu.edu
If you have any additional information or questions related to this, please reply to this email.
